#. module: social_instagram
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/social_instagram/controllers/main.py:0
msgid ""
"You need to link your Instagram page to your Facebook account to post with "
"Odoo Social.\n"
" Please create one and make sure it is linked to your account."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານຕ້ອງເຊື່ອມໂຍງໜ້າ Instagram ຂອງທ່ານກັບບັນຊີ Facebook ເພື່ອໂພສດ້ວຍ Odoo Social.\n"
" ກະລຸນາສ້າງຂຶ້ນມາ ແລະ ຮັບປະກັນວ່າມັນໄດ້ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບບັນຊີຂອງທ່ານແລ້ວ."

#. module: social_instagram
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/social_instagram/models/social_post.py:0
